    {
      "is": "IS 4895:1985",
      "clause": "5",
      "title": "Dimensions",
      "text": "5. Dimensions — The minimum dimensions of the logs shall be the following Length —     2.5 m Mid - girth —  1 m Note —For method of measurement of defects in timber, refer to IS 3364 (Part 1) : 1976  Methods of measurement and evaluvation of defects in timber Part 1 Logs (first revision). For detailed Information, refer to IS  4895 :  1985.Specification for Teak logs (first revision) 2.5× L P",
